  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n* Add support for scrabble score api by @ArtyProf in https://github.com/ArtyProf/Wordnik.Client/pull/27\n* Add support for top example api by @ArtyProf in https://github.com/ArtyProf/Wordnik.Client/pull/28\n* Add support for random word api by @ArtyProf in https://github.com/ArtyProf/Wordnik.Client/pull/29\n* Add support for random words api by @ArtyProf in https://github.com/ArtyProf/Wordnik.Client/pull/30\n* add support for word of the day api by @ArtyProf in https://github.com/ArtyProf/Wordnik.Client/pull/31\n* Update Assembly version to v.1.0.0 by @ArtyProf in https://github.com/ArtyProf/Wordnik.Client/pull/32\n\n## All not deprecated endpoints was implemented from https://developer.wordnik.com/docs\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ArtyProf/Wordnik.Client/compare/v0.2.5...v1.0.0",
